{
  "_comment1": "==============================================================",
  "_comment2": "Vercel 配置文件（.vercel.json）",
  "_comment3": "作用：告诉 Vercel 如何构建和路由你的项目",
  "_comment4": "学习要点：",
  "_comment5": "  - version: Vercel 配置文件的版本号，目前固定为 2",
  "_comment6": "  - builds: 指定哪些文件需要构建，以及用什么构建工具",
  "_comment7": "  - routes: 定义 URL 路径和实际文件之间的映射关系",
  "_comment8": "==============================================================",
  "version": 2,
  "builds": [
    {
      "src": "api/messages.js",
      "use": "@vercel/node"
    }
  ],
  "routes": [
    {
      "src": "/api/messages",
      "dest": "api/messages.js"
    }
  ]
}